#: site-migrator.php (plugin header)
msgid "Migrates text and images from external (non-WordPress) sites into pages or posts. Adds a screen under Tools → Site Migrator and the WP-CLI command \"wp migrate-site\"."
msgstr "Migra texto e imágenes de sitios externos (no WordPress) a páginas o entradas. Agrega una pantalla en Herramientas → Site Migrator y el comando WP-CLI \"wp migrate-site\"."
